+    Scenario: Marking all todos as complete
+      Given the app has todos "Buy groceries" and "Clean house"
+      When the user clicks the toggle all checkbox
+      Then all todos have class "completed"
+      And the todo count shows "0 items left"
+      And the toggle all checkbox is checked
+
+    Scenario: Unmarking all todos
+      Given the app has completed todos "Buy groceries" and "Clean house"
+      When the user clicks the toggle all checkbox
+      Then no todos have class "completed"
+      And the todo count shows "2 items left"
+      And the toggle all checkbox is unchecked
+
+    Scenario: Toggle all preserves list item identity across the interaction
+      Given the app has a todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the app has a todo "Clean house"
+      When the user clicks the toggle all checkbox
